## Checklist

- [ ] Metadata extracted (package, version, SDK levels)
- [ ] Permissions classified by tier
- [ ] Signature schemes and certificate details shown
- [ ] Debug keystore check done
- [ ] Exported components assessed
- [ ] Security flags checked (debuggable, allowBackup, cleartext)
- [ ] Native libraries and SDKs listed
- [ ] Security report produced with severity levels
